                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9096e72-3bd8-3e7f-bb59-347bd8effc54",
                        "entry_id": "f8586b37-8ec8-3b9c-ae44-dacd62cb91d7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Gros bovidé vivant en Asie du Sud-Est également nommé gayal, surtout quand il est domestiqué."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cc30250-cb99-42cf-b559-6006cdb43562",
                                "sense_id": "b9096e72-3bd8-3e7f-bb59-347bd8effc54",
                                "text": "Les bovidés sauvages que l'on rencontre en Inde, les gaurs, présentent une certaine ressemblance avec cette espèce initiale. Le zoologue américain George Schaller a observé un jour une tigresse qui marchait, suivie à une distance de 50 mètres par huit gaurs. Les tigres s'attaquent rarement à un gaur adulte, en raison de sa force considérable et de son courage."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "77c39f75-a076-4c4f-9554-c1953aa75f58",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8586b37-8ec8-3b9c-ae44-dacd62cb91d7",
                        "source_sense_id": "b9096e72-3bd8-3e7f-bb59-347bd8effc54",
                        "source_sense_description": "Gros bovidé vivant en Asie du Sud-Est",
                        "target_lang_word": "Gaur",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Gaur",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a5ebadb-178c-3dba-9493-377465a62c38",
                                        "entry_id": "2f0590a1-93a1-3f0f-9024-2f8cda9026de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "großes, asiatisches Wildrind"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad0e8ec3-11af-447c-aaa7-3bdfb2e127a3",
                                                "sense_id": "3a5ebadb-178c-3dba-9493-377465a62c38",
                                                "text": "Der Gaur ist die größte rezente Rinderart."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8c74f189-fb1d-4343-aea0-7a96abfaf1a4",
                        "source_entry_id": "f8586b37-8ec8-3b9c-ae44-dacd62cb91d7",
                        "source_sense_id": "b9096e72-3bd8-3e7f-bb59-347bd8effc54",
                        "source_sense_description": "Gros bovidé vivant en Asie du Sud-Est",
                        "target_lang_word": "gaur",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gaur",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba69eba1-4b6c-3fd1-b792-472f7a4e1a3b",
                                        "entry_id": "0a07552f-6e46-3567-98dd-f3e20ef69d68",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An Asian species of wild bovine (Bos gaurus), of large size and an untamable disposition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55f34191-0715-4cb4-8745-6919b63e5475",
                                                "sense_id": "ba69eba1-4b6c-3fd1-b792-472f7a4e1a3b",
                                                "text": "[…] I am sure that the American bison is the grandest of them all. His only rivals for the kingship are the Indian bison, or gaur (Bos gaurus), of Southern India, and the aurochs, or European bison, both of which really surpass him in height, if not in actual balk also."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "739da83d-9416-4aa5-822e-28429b53738a",
                                                "sense_id": "ba69eba1-4b6c-3fd1-b792-472f7a4e1a3b",
                                                "text": "Of the other ruminants the ox, buffalo, yak, goat, sheep and a few others are domestic animals, while the bison and the gaur, or so-called Indian bison, and a large number of wild goats and sheep have been neglected."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
